 () => "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserverResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":"[]]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A tuple of the per-query results, a function that computes the combined result, and a\nfunction that returns the results wrapped for property-access tracking."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"getqueries","children":[{"type":"text","value":"getQueries()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"getQueries(): Query<unknown, Error, unknown, readonly unknown[]>[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L228","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:228"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns the underlying "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Query"},{"type":"text","value":" instances currently being observed, in\nthe same order as the queries passed to the constructor or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"setQueries"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-6","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"Query.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Query"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Error"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[]>[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The observed queries."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"haslisteners","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hasListeners()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"hasListeners(): boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts#L43","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts:43"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" while at least one listener is registered, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"false"},{"type":"text","value":" once they have all unsubscribed."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-7","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":" if at least one listener is registered."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inherited-from","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inherited from"}]},{"type":"code","value":"Subscribable.hasListeners","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"setqueries","children":[{"type":"text","value":"setQueries()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"setQueries(queries: QueryObserverOptions<unknown, Error, unknown, unknown, readonly unknown[], never>[], options?: QueriesObserverOptions<TCombinedResult>): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L136","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:136"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Replaces the set of queries being observed. Existing "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserver"},{"type":"text","value":"s\nare reused for queries that match an already-observed query hash;\nobservers for queries that are no longer present are destroyed, and new\nobservers are created and subscribed to for newly added queries."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"queries-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queries"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserverOptions"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Error"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":", readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[], "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"never"},{"type":"text","value":">[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options of the queries to observe."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"options-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueriesObserverOptions.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueriesObserverOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TCombinedResult"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Replaces the observer's options, e.g. its "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"combine"},{"type":"text","value":" function."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-8","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"observer.setQueries([\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 3], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"subscribe","children":[{"type":"text","value":"subscribe()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"subscribe(listener: QueriesObserverListener): () => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts#L28","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts:28"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Registers a listener to be called on every update this object notifies about. Returns a function\nthat removes the listener again — call it to stop listening. The base class never drops a listener\non its own, though some subclasses clear all of theirs in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"destroy()"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"listener","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listener"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueriesObserverListener"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called on each update, with whatever the subclass passes to its subscribers."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-9","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A function that removes the listener."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"() => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const unsubscribe = subscribable.subscribe(() => {\n  // react to the update\n})\n\nunsubscribe()","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"inherited-from-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Inherited from"}]},{"type":"code","value":"Subscribable.subscribe","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"extends","text":"Extends","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tcombinedresult","text":"TCombinedResult","level":3},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"client","text":"client","level":5},{"id":"queries","text":"queries","level":5},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"overrides","text":"Overrides","level":4},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"destroy","text":"destroy()","level":3},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"getcurrentresult","text":"getCurrentResult()","level":3},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"example-2","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"getobservers","text":"getObservers()","level":3},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"getoptimisticresult","text":"getOptimisticResult()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"queries-2","text":"queries","level":5},{"id":"combine","text":"combine","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"getqueries","text":"getQueries()","level":3},{"id":"returns-6","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"haslisteners","text":"hasListeners()","level":3},{"id":"returns-7","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"inherited-from","text":"Inherited from","level":4},{"id":"setqueries","text":"setQueries()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-3","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"queries-3","text":"queries","level":5},{"id":"options-2","text":"options?","level":5},{"id":"returns-8","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"example-3","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"subscribe","text":"subscribe()","level":3},{"id":"parameters-4","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"listener","text":"listener","level":5},{"id":"returns-9","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"example-4","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"inherited-from-2","text":"Inherited from","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:64](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L64)\n\nA `QueriesObserver` watches an array of queries at once, exposing them as\na single array of `QueryObserverResult`s (or, when a `combine` option is\ngiven, as a combined value derived from that array). It manages one\ninternal `QueryObserver` per query, and is the primitive that framework\nadapters (e.g. `useQueries`) build their hooks on top of.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst observer = new QueriesObserver(queryClient, [\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 2], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe((result) => {\n  console.log(result)\n})\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Subscribable`\\<`QueriesObserverListener`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TCombinedResult\n\n`TCombinedResult` = [`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew QueriesObserver<TCombinedResult>(\n   client: QueryClient, \n   queries: QueryObserverOptions<any, any, any, any, any, never>[], \noptions?: QueriesObserverOptions<TCombinedResult>): QueriesObserver<TCombinedResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:78](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L78)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### client\n\n`QueryClient`\n\n##### queries\n\n`QueryObserverOptions`\\<`any`, `any`, `any`, `any`, `any`, `never`\\>[]\n\n##### options?\n\n[`QueriesObserverOptions`](../interfaces/QueriesObserverOptions.md)\\<`TCombinedResult`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`QueriesObserver`\\<`TCombinedResult`\\>\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nSubscribable<QueriesObserverListener>.constructor\n```\n\n## Methods\n\n### destroy()\n\n```ts\ndestroy(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:114](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L114)\n\nStops observing all queries: clears all listeners and destroys every\nunderlying `QueryObserver` this observer manages.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### getCurrentResult()\n\n```ts\ngetCurrentResult(): QueryObserverResult[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:219](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L219)\n\nReturns the most recently computed array of `QueryObserverResult`s, one\nper observed query, in the same order as the queries passed to the\nconstructor or `setQueries`.\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]\n\nThe current results.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nconst results = observer.getCurrentResult()\nconst data = results.map((result) => result.data)\n```\n\n***\n\n### getObservers()\n\n```ts\ngetObservers(): QueryObserver<unknown, Error, unknown, unknown, readonly unknown[]>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:238](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L238)\n\nReturns the underlying `QueryObserver` instances this observer manages,\nin the same order as the queries passed to the constructor or\n`setQueries`.\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`QueryObserver`](QueryObserver.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[]\\>[]\n\nThe managed query observers.\n\n***\n\n### getOptimisticResult()\n\n```ts\ngetOptimisticResult(queries: QueryObserverOptions<unknown, Error, unknown, unknown, readonly unknown[], never>[], combine: CombineFn<TCombinedResult> | undefined): [QueryObserverResult[], (r?: QueryObserverResult[]) => TCombinedResult, () => QueryObserverResult[]];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:253](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L253)\n\nThe `QueriesObserver` counterpart of [QueryObserver#getOptimisticResult](QueryObserver.md#getoptimisticresult) — computes\nthe result for the given (already-defaulted) queries right now, synchronously. Called by\nframework adapters (e.g. `useQueries`) ahead of subscribing, returning a tuple of the raw\nper-query results, a function to compute the combined result from them, and a function to\nwrap the results for property-access tracking.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### queries\n\n`QueryObserverOptions`\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[], `never`\\>[]\n\nThe defaulted options of the queries to compute the result for.\n\n##### combine\n\n`CombineFn`\\<`TCombinedResult`\\> \\| `undefined`\n\nThe `combine` function used by the returned `combineResult`, if any.\n\n#### Returns\n\n\\[[`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[], (`r?`: [`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]) => `TCombinedResult`, () => [`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]\\]\n\nA tuple of the per-query results, a function that computes the combined result, and a\nfunction that returns the results wrapped for property-access tracking.\n\n***\n\n### getQueries()\n\n```ts\ngetQueries(): Query<unknown, Error, unknown, readonly unknown[]>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:228](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L228)\n\nReturns the underlying `Query` instances currently being observed, in\nthe same order as the queries passed to the constructor or `setQueries`.\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`Query`](Query.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[]\\>[]\n\nThe observed queries.\n\n***\n\n### hasListeners()\n\n```ts\nhasListeners(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts:43](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts#L43)\n\nReturns `true` while at least one listener is registered, `false` once they have all unsubscribed.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n`true` if at least one listener is registered.\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n```ts\nSubscribable.hasListeners\n```\n\n***\n\n### setQueries()\n\n```ts\nsetQueries(queries: QueryObserverOptions<unknown, Error, unknown, unknown, readonly unknown[], never>[], options?: QueriesObserverOptions<TCombinedResult>): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:136](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L136)\n\nReplaces the set of queries being observed. Existing `QueryObserver`s\nare reused for queries that match an already-observed query hash;\nobservers for queries that are no longer present are destroyed, and new\nobservers are created and subscribed to for newly added queries.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### queries\n\n`QueryObserverOptions`\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[], `never`\\>[]\n\nThe options of the queries to observe.\n\n##### options?\n\n[`QueriesObserverOptions`](../interfaces/QueriesObserverOptions.md)\\<`TCombinedResult`\\>\n\nReplaces the observer's options, e.g. its `combine` function.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nobserver.setQueries([\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 3], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])\n```\n\n***\n\n### subscribe()\n\n```ts\nsubscribe(listener: QueriesObserverListener): () => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts#L28)\n\nRegisters a listener to be called on every update this object notifies about. Returns a function\nthat removes the listener again — call it to stop listening. The base class never drops a listener\non its own, though some subclasses clear all of theirs in `destroy()`.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### listener\n\n`QueriesObserverListener`\n\nCalled on each update, with whatever the subclass passes to its subscribers.\n\n#### Returns\n\nA function that removes the listener.\n\n() => `void`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nconst unsubscribe = subscribable.subscribe(() => {\n  // react to the update\n})\n\nunsubscribe()\n```\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n```ts\nSubscribable.subscribe\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueriesObserver\ntitle: QueriesObserver\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:64](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L64)\n\nA `QueriesObserver` watches an array of queries at once, exposing them as\na single array of `QueryObserverResult`s (or, when a `combine` option is\ngiven, as a combined value derived from that array). It manages one\ninternal `QueryObserver` per query, and is the primitive that framework\nadapters (e.g. `useQueries`) build their hooks on top of.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst observer = new QueriesObserver(queryClient, [\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 2], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe((result) => {\n  console.log(result)\n})\n```\n\n## Extends\n\n- `Subscribable`\\<`QueriesObserverListener`\\>\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TCombinedResult\n\n`TCombinedResult` = [`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew QueriesObserver<TCombinedResult>(\n   client: QueryClient, \n   queries: QueryObserverOptions<any, any, any, any, any, never>[], \noptions?: QueriesObserverOptions<TCombinedResult>): QueriesObserver<TCombinedResult>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:78](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L78)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### client\n\n`QueryClient`\n\n##### queries\n\n`QueryObserverOptions`\\<`any`, `any`, `any`, `any`, `any`, `never`\\>[]\n\n##### options?\n\n[`QueriesObserverOptions`](../interfaces/QueriesObserverOptions.md)\\<`TCombinedResult`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`QueriesObserver`\\<`TCombinedResult`\\>\n\n#### Overrides\n\n```ts\nSubscribable<QueriesObserverListener>.constructor\n```\n\n## Methods\n\n### destroy()\n\n```ts\ndestroy(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:114](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L114)\n\nStops observing all queries: clears all listeners and destroys every\nunderlying `QueryObserver` this observer manages.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n***\n\n### getCurrentResult()\n\n```ts\ngetCurrentResult(): QueryObserverResult[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:219](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L219)\n\nReturns the most recently computed array of `QueryObserverResult`s, one\nper observed query, in the same order as the queries passed to the\nconstructor or `setQueries`.\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]\n\nThe current results.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nconst results = observer.getCurrentResult()\nconst data = results.map((result) => result.data)\n```\n\n***\n\n### getObservers()\n\n```ts\ngetObservers(): QueryObserver<unknown, Error, unknown, unknown, readonly unknown[]>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:238](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L238)\n\nReturns the underlying `QueryObserver` instances this observer manages,\nin the same order as the queries passed to the constructor or\n`setQueries`.\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`QueryObserver`](QueryObserver.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[]\\>[]\n\nThe managed query observers.\n\n***\n\n### getOptimisticResult()\n\n```ts\ngetOptimisticResult(queries: QueryObserverOptions<unknown, Error, unknown, unknown, readonly unknown[], never>[], combine: CombineFn<TCombinedResult> | undefined): [QueryObserverResult[], (r?: QueryObserverResult[]) => TCombinedResult, () => QueryObserverResult[]];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:253](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L253)\n\nThe `QueriesObserver` counterpart of [QueryObserver#getOptimisticResult](QueryObserver.md#getoptimisticresult) — computes\nthe result for the given (already-defaulted) queries right now, synchronously. Called by\nframework adapters (e.g. `useQueries`) ahead of subscribing, returning a tuple of the raw\nper-query results, a function to compute the combined result from them, and a function to\nwrap the results for property-access tracking.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### queries\n\n`QueryObserverOptions`\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[], `never`\\>[]\n\nThe defaulted options of the queries to compute the result for.\n\n##### combine\n\n`CombineFn`\\<`TCombinedResult`\\> \\| `undefined`\n\nThe `combine` function used by the returned `combineResult`, if any.\n\n#### Returns\n\n\\[[`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[], (`r?`: [`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]) => `TCombinedResult`, () => [`QueryObserverResult`](../type-aliases/QueryObserverResult.md)[]\\]\n\nA tuple of the per-query results, a function that computes the combined result, and a\nfunction that returns the results wrapped for property-access tracking.\n\n***\n\n### getQueries()\n\n```ts\ngetQueries(): Query<unknown, Error, unknown, readonly unknown[]>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:228](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L228)\n\nReturns the underlying `Query` instances currently being observed, in\nthe same order as the queries passed to the constructor or `setQueries`.\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`Query`](Query.md)\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[]\\>[]\n\nThe observed queries.\n\n***\n\n### hasListeners()\n\n```ts\nhasListeners(): boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts:43](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts#L43)\n\nReturns `true` while at least one listener is registered, `false` once they have all unsubscribed.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n`true` if at least one listener is registered.\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n```ts\nSubscribable.hasListeners\n```\n\n***\n\n### setQueries()\n\n```ts\nsetQueries(queries: QueryObserverOptions<unknown, Error, unknown, unknown, readonly unknown[], never>[], options?: QueriesObserverOptions<TCombinedResult>): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts:136](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/queriesObserver.ts#L136)\n\nReplaces the set of queries being observed. Existing `QueryObserver`s\nare reused for queries that match an already-observed query hash;\nobservers for queries that are no longer present are destroyed, and new\nobservers are created and subscribed to for newly added queries.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### queries\n\n`QueryObserverOptions`\\<`unknown`, `Error`, `unknown`, `unknown`, readonly `unknown`[], `never`\\>[]\n\nThe options of the queries to observe.\n\n##### options?\n\n[`QueriesObserverOptions`](../interfaces/QueriesObserverOptions.md)\\<`TCombinedResult`\\>\n\nReplaces the observer's options, e.g. its `combine` function.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nobserver.setQueries([\n  { queryKey: ['post', 1], queryFn: fetchPost },\n  { queryKey: ['post', 3], queryFn: fetchPost },\n])\n```\n\n***\n\n### subscribe()\n\n```ts\nsubscribe(listener: QueriesObserverListener): () => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts:28](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/subscribable.ts#L28)\n\nRegisters a listener to be called on every update this object notifies about. Returns a function\nthat removes the listener again — call it to stop listening. The base class never drops a listener\non its own, though some subclasses clear all of theirs in `destroy()`.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### listener\n\n`QueriesObserverListener`\n\nCalled on each update, with whatever the subclass passes to its subscribers.\n\n#### Returns\n\nA function that removes the listener.\n\n() => `void`\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nconst unsubscribe = subscribable.subscribe(() => {\n  // react to the update\n})\n\nunsubscribe()\n```\n\n#### Inherited from\n\n```ts\nSubscribable.subscribe\n```\n"}
